-  <div class="section-label">// Recognition</div>
-  <h2>Track Record</h2>
-  <p>Awarded <strong>Circle of Excellence</strong> ten times for outstanding customer experience at Avaya, with CSAT scores of 4.9/5 ranked among top performers globally. Delivered 15+ complex global service transitions with zero critical post-go-live failures, and earlier in career, 20+ transitions with zero Sev-1 incidents. ITIL Expert, PRINCE2 Practitioner, AWS Certified Solutions Architect, with recent additions in LangChain, LangSmith, and MCP reflecting continued hands-on depth in the AI tooling that underpins current advisory work.</p>
